## General

| Name  | Platform | Purpose  | Why I use it | Source  |
| ------------- | ------------- | ------------- | ------------- | ------------- |
| C | C | C | C | C |
| Linux | Something with electricity | Makes most free operating systems possible | I like to control my OS, I don't like it controlling me | https://github.com/torvalds/linux (kernel) |
| Fedora Linux | amd64, aarch64 | Linux distribution (OS) | Widely supported, reliable developers, fast but sensible update cycle, large community | https://fedoraproject.org/ |
| Firefox | All | Web browser | The only viable non-Chromium browser for me | https://github.com/mozilla-firefox/firefox |
| SyncThing | All | File synchronizer | Synchronizes files between all my devices without relying on a server. Pretty much magic. | https://github.com/ip7z/7zip |
| qBittorrent | Linux/Mac/Windows | BitTorrent client | I can't believe I used to use uTorrent... | https://github.com/qbittorrent/qBittorrent |
| 7zip | Windows/Linux | File archiver | I use it on Windows, efficient and doesn't ask for money at every launch | https://github.com/ip7z/7zip |

## Text processing/office

| Name  | Platform | Purpose  | Why I use it | Repo  |
| ------------- | ------------- | ------------- | ------------- | ------------- |
| Libre Office | Linux/Mac/Windows | Full office suite | Fully replaces MS Office for me | https://git.libreoffice.org/ |
| NotepadPlusPlus | Windows | Text editor | Opens literally everything without questions | https://github.com/notepad-plus-plus/notepad-plus-plus |
| Kate | Linux/Mac/Windows | Text/code editor | Amazingly fills a niche between a simple "notepad" and a heavyweight IDE | https://invent.kde.org/utilities/kate |

